    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Wanting to do: ～たい です",
     "texto": [
      "To say you want to do something, drop **ます** from the verb and add **たい です**: **いきます** → **いきたい です** (I want to go), **たべます** → **たべたい です** (I want to eat), **みます** → **みたい です** (I want to see).",
      "It is only used to talk about **yourself**, or to ask the other person."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "tabla",
     "titulo": "I want…",
     "columnas": [
      {
       "texto": "Verb",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "I want",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      },
      {
       "texto": "English",
       "lengua": "alumno"
      }
     ],
