    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Going to do something",
     "texto": [
      "To say what you are going to do, use activity + **に いきます**: **かいもの に いきます** (I'm going shopping).",
      "The future is expressed with the same form as the present; what changes is the time word: **あした** (tomorrow), **こんばん** (tonight), **らいしゅう** (next week)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
